	(text "NOTES\n1. Variant D of the Rev B control PCB (layout-revB.md). Placement: KiCad top view = front view, Y_front = -Y_kicad.\n2. BOM: 12 x 10k (R1-R12, axial 0207), 10 x 10 nF (C1-C10, KEMET C317, 5.08 mm leads -> P5.00 footprint).\n3. Project-local symbols/footprints: control.kicad_sym / control.pretty. SW3 SKQUCAA010 footprint: see README (TBV).\n4. ENC1 PEC11R: A-C-B order per Bourns; print the footprints 1:1 and test-fit before ordering."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
