	)
	(text "J1 = Hirose FH12-16S-0.5SH(55), 0.5 mm, 16 pins, on the BOTTOM side, slot at the top PCB edge.\nCable: 30 mm, 16-way, 0.5 mm, SAME-SIDE contacts (GCT 05-16-A-0030-A-4-06-4-T).\nThe adapter PCB (kicad-adapter-J8) plugs into the Waveshare J8 (female 2x17) with a 2x17 male header.\nThe cable is not mirrored: each conductor keeps its X position, so adapter J2 pin k = control J1 pin 17-k.\nUSB-present sense (R1 2.2k / R2 4.7k from J8-31 USB 5 V to J8-10 EXIO7) is on the adapter: no 5 V on the cable.\nJ8-2 BAT, J8-31 USB 5 V and the unused GPIOs stay on the adapter (not connected)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "02aa3cda-089d-4de0-8e45-3f53af938130")
	)
